content.text:
Claim checked against the CSV: memo's end value is wrong. `eval-run/runs/p3/answer.md` written with VERDICT: FALSE, ACTUAL_END_CHURN: 6.8%, plus one citing sentence.

- Memo: churn 8.1% → 5.9% by month 9
- CSV: month 1 = 8.1% (matches), month 9 = 6.8% (does not match); the series declines monotonically but never reaches 5.9%

